{"summary":"Beautiful perspective puzzles","description":"Imagine a room where a TV seems to be sitting on a table. But when you look at it from another angle, it appears to be floating in mid-air. Magic? No. Perspective? Yes.\n\nWelcome to a world where your eyes deceive you every day. Welcome to the world of Possessions - a minimalist 3D puzzle game about perspective and spatial awareness.\n\nIn Possessions, you will look at various objects from different angles until they appear in their right place, all while learning the story of a family inhabiting the house.\n\nELEGANT DESIGN\nColourful and minimalist 3D visuals that are a treat to your eyes. Explore multiple rooms, each with its unique setting.\n\nA TALE OF A FAMILY\nWitness the life and struggles of a family's story, crafted without dialogue or text.\n\nENJOY WITH EASE\nSimply rotate the room to change the perspective. Designed to be easy for everyone to pick up and enjoy.\n\nMESMERIZING AUDIO\nLose yourself in the soothing soundtrack, which complements the game and enhances the experience.\n\nMULTIPLE LEVELS OF FUN\nEnjoy evolving and challenging gameplay with different mechanics in 33 hand-crafted levels.","esrbNotes":"Alcohol Reference","pegiNotes":null,"iapPrices":"$1.99 - $2.99 per item","video":"https://www.youtube.com/embed/-rK8b7xSf8M?vq=large&rel=0&autohide=1&showinfo=0","header":"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/5poqLSV3jaeM7NAjhX5nSnUgyfTdyKbnNTsvSdRYpeO4rteKJNRzGpoMRlFbm8tf8Tb1dOZI4qAgnTwzne9y","screenshots":["https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/iaFTTxifDJojk2XCuynIpVr_DZpVi_r4rk3VKzWezinz2VT4sOx8Gip6yiublL9YmCKjYnVkw-jQxeACJID99Q","https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/dOfzP7cm4Y2cTJ8XssvE0JXnD_IdmyNgXNPI6Mj0o7-5IgkHbTlZEbfz8R11hRe8eMEvaz5_YBOe5ClUcZdW-Z8","https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/kvGsNoG7LW_9zMuWu-pPthmzAMNu5vDjSTBXAsk_lm-6MlT_O9vyhMGnUgwNbC8g9y9oSH1uzn5MTJjepi7Y1g","https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/qBHvAhNMQuTqCPqPLoJgQX1eplEGx00_bbnIolDm6U8vWnjQdzQSclHTwuxBvq5KPDha8